# Allow-list, not deny-list.
#
# The first version of this file enumerated sensitive paths and missed four of
# them — tokens.json, *.tokens.json, controllers.json and .unifi-api-key are all
# marked sensitive in .gitignore. Enumerating what to exclude means the context
# grows a hole every time a new local file appears. So: exclude everything, then
# re-include exactly what the Dockerfile copies.

*

# What the build actually needs
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rustunifimcp/
!rustunifimcp-core/

# Re-exclude sensitive and generated paths that live *inside* those directories.
# A later pattern wins, so these override the re-inclusions above.
**/target/
rustunifimcp-core/tests/fixtures/
**/tokens.json
**/*.tokens.json
**/controllers.json
**/*.unifikey
**/.unifikey
**/.unifi-api-key
**/.env
**/.env.*
